    // the collection-window classification (stale/legacy/malformed) to its
    // carried comparison, the added branch does not. A carried B whose
    // collection completed STRICTLY BEFORE the baseline read started is old
    // evidence the runtime's adjudicateLocalExit discards (the stale carry
    // never latches — the round-22 F2 pre-filter's stale arm) before
    // returning the lawful disappeared; replaying the same schedule
    // produced ancestry-endpoint-generation-foreign. The baseCarriedExact
